 169:common/prog/dbus/dbusmapping.h **** /**
 170:common/prog/dbus/dbusmapping.h ****  \brief Function called by data link layer for getting the circulating timer tick.
 171:common/prog/dbus/dbusmapping.h ****         This value runs from 0x00 to 0xFFFFFFFF and then starts at 0x00 again.
 172:common/prog/dbus/dbusmapping.h ****  \return Circulating 32bit counter value\n
